[{"text":"ToHypergeometric[t^b (1 - t)^c (1+tz)^a,t] returns u^a Gamma[b+1] Gamma[c+1]/Gamma[b+c+2] Hypergeometric2F1[-a,b+1,b+c+2,-z/u]. Remember that \\(\\textrm{Re}(b) >0\\) and \\(\\textrm{Re} (c-b) > 0\\) should hold (need not be set in Mathematica).","anchor":"tohypergeometric"},{"text":"Overview, HypergeometricAC, HypergeometricIR, HypergeometricSE.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"ToHypergeometric[t^b (1 - t)^c (1 + t z)^a, t]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\Gamma (b+1) \\Gamma (c+1) \\, _2F_1(-a,b+1;b+c+2;-z)}{\\Gamma (b+c+2)}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ToHypergeometric[w t^(b - 1) (1 - t)^(c - b - 1) (1 - t z)^-a, t]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{w \\Gamma (b) \\Gamma (c-b) \\, _2F_1(a,b;c;z)}{\\Gamma (c)}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ToHypergeometric[t^b (1 - t)^c (u + t z)^a, t]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{u^a \\Gamma (b+1) \\Gamma (c+1) \\, _2F_1\\left(-a,b+1;b+c+2;-\\frac{z}{u}\\right)}{\\Gamma (b+c+2)}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ToHypergeometric[w t^(b - 1) (1 - t)^(c - b - 1) (u - t z)^-a, t]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{w u^{-a} \\Gamma (b) \\Gamma (c-b) \\, _2F_1\\left(a,b;c;\\frac{z}{u}\\right)}{\\Gamma (c)}\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"}]